<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-SICK EDBERG PULLS OUT OF LYON TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SICK EDBERG PULLS OUT OF LYON TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>LYON, France 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>A bout of flu has forced Stefan Edberg out of the Lyon grand prix which began on Monday.</p>
<p>Organisers said he had telephoned them to say he would not be fit to play until the weekend.</p>
<p>Edberg, seeded seven, rejected an offer to have his first round match postponed until Wednesday.</p>
</text>
